; that corrected it is in the work-package stand. They are keys all the same,
; and a key an identifier does NOT carry is observable: it decides
; `is not a valid keyword` versus a pattern qualifier's own diagnostic, and
; every `make` and pattern dispatch reads the key, never the spelling.
